{% comment %}
  ============================================================================
  Article Detail Page — custom content section (task 0007, round 4)
  ============================================================================
  Replaces the native `main-blog-post` section on `templates/article.json` for the same reason
  every other page in this build went custom: DXB wants production's exact bounded-card look
  (buyflorabella_restore/dev/frontend/app/routes/article.$blogHandle.$articleHandle.tsx), which
  the native block-composed section doesn't produce out of the box.

  MATCHES PRODUCTION:
  - "← Back to Articles" breadcrumb above the card, linking to the Learn hub page.
  - A single bounded, rounded, drop-shadowed card holding the featured image + all content
    (background color and corner radius both configurable, per DXB's request).
  - Category badge (article.blog.title — the real Blog name, e.g. "Soil Education") + read time
    with a clock icon, inline row above the title.
  - Author (icon + article.author) + published date (icon + article.published_at) on the left of
    a second row.

  DELIBERATE DEVIATIONS FROM PRODUCTION, PER DXB:
  - **No Table of Contents.** Production has a sticky sidebar TOC built from a client-side
    IntersectionObserver watching the article's own h2/h3 headings — DXB asked to drop this
    concept entirely, not port it. Body content is a single column instead of the
    two-column body+TOC split production uses.
  - **Share is copy-link only, no native OS share sheet.** Production's Share button tries
    `navigator.share()` first (mobile share sheet) and only falls back to clipboard copy. DXB
    asked specifically for "an easy copy-to-clipboard the URL" — simpler, no share-sheet branch,
    no Bookmark button (production has one gated behind a feature flag; not asked for here).

  READ TIME: not a native Article field. Production's own calculation
  (`article.$blogHandle.$articleHandle.tsx`'s `calculateReadTime`) is
  `Math.ceil(strip_html(content).split(/\s+/).length / 200) || 1` — word count over a flat
  200 words/minute, rounded UP, floored at 1. This section uses the same word-count/200wpm
  formula already shipped on the Learn page's Articles/Guides sections
  (`divided_by: 200 | at_least: 1`, which rounds down instead of up) for consistency across the
  site's read-time numbers, rather than reintroducing a second, slightly different formula for
  just this one page — per DXB's own call that pixel-exact replication of this specific
  calculation isn't necessary.

  SHARE BUTTON: vanilla JS, `navigator.clipboard.writeText(window.location.href)`, with a brief
  "Copied!" label swap for feedback — no dependencies, progressive enhancement (button still
  exists and links nowhere destructive if JS fails to run, it simply won't respond to clicks).

  COLOR: no hardcoded hex. Page background falls back to color_palette.color11 (light, matching
  every other page's light wash). Card background is an independent setting, falling back to
  color_palette.background. Accent (category badge, share button hover) falls back to color3.

  DEPLOY: written directly into this live repo's working tree as part of the 2026-09-07
  live-edit pilot (see claude_docs/build_docs/live_edit_pilot_plan.md) — DXB reviews, then
  commits and pushes by hand.
  ============================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign accent = section.settings.accent_color | default: settings.color_palette.color3
  assign bg = section.settings.background_color | default: settings.color_palette.color11
  assign card_bg = section.settings.card_background_color | default: settings.color_palette.background
  assign corner_radius = section.settings.card_corner_radius | default: 24

  assign word_count = article.content | strip_html | split: ' ' | size
  assign read_minutes = word_count | divided_by: 200
  assign read_minutes = read_minutes | at_least: 1

  if section.settings.background_color != blank
    render 'contrast-override', background_color: section.settings.background_color, section_id: section.id, skip_contrast: true
  endif
%}

<div
  id="ArticleContent-{{ section.id }}"
  class="bfbella-article-content{% if section.settings.background_color != blank %} color-custom-{{ section.id }}{% endif %}"
  style="
    --bfbella-accent: {{ accent }};
    --bfbella-bg: {{ bg }};
    --bfbella-card-bg: {{ card_bg }};
    --bfbella-card-radius: {{ corner_radius }}px;
    {% if section.settings.padding_top != blank %}--bfbella-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;{% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.padding_bottom != blank %}--bfbella-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;{% endif %}
  "
>
  <div class="bfbella-article-content__inner page-width">
    <a href="{{ section.settings.back_link | default: '/pages/learn' }}" class="bfbella-article-content__back">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/>
        <polyline points="12,19 5,12 12,5"/>
      </svg>
      {{ section.settings.back_label | default: 'Back to Articles' }}
    </a>

    <div class="bfbella-article-content__card">
      {%- if article.image -%}
        <div class="bfbella-article-content__media">
          <img
            src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ article.image.alt | escape }}"
            width="1200"
            height="{{ 1200 | divided_by: article.image.aspect_ratio }}"
          >
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="bfbella-article-content__body">
        <div class="bfbella-article-content__meta">
          {%- if article.blog.title != blank -%}
            <span class="bfbella-article-content__category">{{ article.blog.title }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="bfbella-article-content__readtime">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/>
            </svg>
            {{ read_minutes }} min read
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="bfbella-article-content__title">{{ article.title }}</h1>

        <div class="bfbella-article-content__byline">
          <div class="bfbella-article-content__byline-info">
            <span class="bfbella-article-content__author">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
              </svg>
              {{ article.author | default: 'Staff' }}
            </span>
            <span class="bfbella-article-content__date">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/>
                <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/>
                <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/>
                <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
              </svg>
              {{ article.published_at | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}
            </span>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="bfbella-article-content__share" data-share-url="{{ shop.url }}{{ article.url }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/>
              <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/>
              <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/>
              <line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"/>
              <line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="bfbella-article-content__share-label">Share</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="bfbella-article-content__prose">
          {{ article.content }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('ArticleContent-{{ section.id }}');
    if (!root) return;
    var button = root.querySelector('.bfbella-article-content__share');
    if (!button) return;
    var label = button.querySelector('.bfbella-article-content__share-label');
    button.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var url = button.getAttribute('data-share-url');
      if (!navigator.clipboard) return;
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(url).then(function () {
        var original = label.textContent;
        label.textContent = 'Copied!';
        setTimeout(function () {
          label.textContent = original;
        }, 2000);
      });
    });
  })();
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-article-content {
    position: relative;
    padding-block-start: var(--bfbella-pad-top, 3rem);
    padding-block-end: var(--bfbella-pad-bottom, 5rem);
    background-color: var(--bfbella-bg);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__inner {
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    opacity: 0.7;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-block-end: 1.5rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__back:hover {
    opacity: 1;
    color: var(--bfbella-accent);
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__back svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__card {
    background-color: var(--bfbella-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--bfbella-card-radius, 1.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__media {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 32rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__body {
    padding: 2rem;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      padding: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__category {
    color: var(--bfbella-accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__readtime {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__readtime svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-block-end: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__byline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-block-end: 2rem;
    margin-block-end: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.1);
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__byline-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__author,
  .bfbella-article-content__date {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__author {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__date {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__author svg,
  .bfbella-article-content__date svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__share {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    appearance: none;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / 0.15);
    background-color: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__share:hover {
    border-color: var(--bfbella-accent);
    color: var(--bfbella-accent);
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__share svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose {
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose :is(h2, h3, h4) {
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-block: 1.75rem 0.75rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose p {
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose ul,
  .bfbella-article-content__prose ol {
    margin-block-end: 1.25rem;
    padding-inline-start: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose li {
    margin-block-end: 0.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose a {
    color: var(--bfbella-accent);
  }

  .bfbella-article-content__prose img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BFBella — Article Content",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "back_label",
      "label": "Back link label",
      "default": "Back to Articles"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "back_link",
      "label": "Back link URL",
      "info": "Defaults to the Learn hub page (/pages/learn) if left blank."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Accent color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "Leave blank to use the theme's existing color3 (brand green) swatch."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Page background color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "The outer page wash, behind the card."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "card_background_color",
      "label": "Card background color",
      "placeholder": "t:settings.default",
      "info": "The bounded, rounded card holding the article — independent from the page background above."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_corner_radius",
      "label": "Card corner radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "BFBella — Article Content",
      "category": "Custom"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
